# Combat (wowsims.com): the wowsims/forever default APL for Combat (ui/specs/rogue/dps/apls/default.apl.json), translated to this addon's keys.
# Data: wowsims/forever (MIT, https://github.com/wowsims/forever) at ab0f00e4fc83.
# WoW Forever leveling and nonraid PvE priorities follow Icy Veins, with learned-spell and weapon fallbacks.
# The sustained raid damage priority follows the pinned WoWSims build.
# Poison reminders and each hand's preference have their own Rogue settings. Stealth is suggested for outdoor pulls with a usable opener.

# Generated by `make wowsims-packs` (tools/wowsims/apl.lua) from tools/wowsims/specs/rogue_combat.lua: edit that recipe, not this file.
# Setting evasion_health (player health threshold, percent), default 50.
# Setting healing_potion_health (player health threshold, percent), default 25.
# Setting healthstone_health (player health threshold, percent), default 30.
# Deviation: default #21: remainingTime is the target's time to die on this line: its value is lost if this target dies first (owner rule, L1902).
# Deviation: default #24: remainingTime is the target's time to die on this line: its value is lost if this target dies first (owner rule, L1902).
# Deviation: default #25: frontOfTarget is the request's in-front setting (behind the target); the client gives no facing.
# Omitted: precombat #3: never
# Omitted: default #1: never
# Omitted: default #2: never
# Omitted: default #5: never
# Omitted: default #17: other OtherActionOffensivePotion
# Omitted: default #26: never
# Omitted: default #27: never
# Omitted: maintain_expose #1: never
# Omitted: energy_pooling_checks #1: strictSequence of waitUntil (held: carried onto the later lines)
# Omitted: default: empty group energy_pooling_checks

